+         span beneath it. This holds in one direction only: `escalate` and `error` also emit no
+         child execute span, so a childless decision span does not by itself identify a denial.
+         Consumers MUST partition on `gen_ai.agent.authorization.outcome`. Span shape separates
+         "evaluated" from "never attempted" (invariant 1), not one outcome from another.
+
+      Scope: this operation models one evaluation by a deciding component and records the answer
+      that component gave, not the final disposition of the action. A decision that defers to a
+      higher authority (`outcome` = `escalate`) is complete when the deferral is recorded. A
+      resolution reached outside that evaluation is not a second evaluation and is not represented
+      by this operation, so an execution that follows an out-of-band approval carries no decision
+      span of its own.
+
